{
  "slug": "flow-studio-power-automate",
  "name": "Flow Studio Power Automate",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build, debug, and operate Power Automate cloud flows from Claude Code through Flow Studio MCP. Exposes action-level inputs and outputs, loop iterations, and nested child flow failures so agents can diagnose issues, compare runs, and deploy fixes. Includes skills for flow operations, debugging, and flow scaffolding. Requires a Flow Studio MCP subscription.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `power-automate-build` (Build, scaffold, and deploy Power Automate cloud flows using the FlowStudio MCP server), `power-automate-debug` (Debug failing Power Automate cloud flows using the FlowStudio MCP server), `power-automate-governance` (Govern Power Automate flows and Power Apps at scale using the FlowStudio MCP cached store), `power-automate-mcp` (Foundation skill for Power Automate via FlowStudio MCP — auth setup, the reusable MCP helper (Python + Node.js),…), `power-automate-monitoring` (Pro+ subscription required)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install flow-studio-power-automate@claude-community` from `ninihen1/power-automate-mcp-skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
